<title>FRANCE: Cap Gemini sees 97 results matching expectations.</title>
<headline>Cap Gemini sees 97 results matching expectations.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cap Gemini said on Thursday that its results due to be announced on July 10 should be &quot;in line with the expectations of its shareholders&quot;.</p>
<p>It gave no further details, but the market consensus expectation is for a net profit of around 500 million francs in 1997 after 282 million in 1996.</p>
<p>It made the comment in a statement.</p>
</text>
